      "message": "Oh, interesting. I must\u0027ve deleted that line by mistake. Restored.\n\nBTW, I notice that the emscripten code does sk_ref_sp and a buffer.release(). Does the non-emscripten refcounting look correct, or should I be calling buffer.release() as well? Or perhaps I should be capturing \"this\" with a refcounted pointer, to ensure the buffer lives as long as the lambda?",
