      "writtenOn": "2025-12-02T21:39:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay so we want to make the map call during playback. Like an alternative is up in prepareForReturnToCache we could do something like:\n```\nif enscripten\n   this-\u003easyncMap(...)\nelse\n   this-\u003emap() // this will do a \"synchronous\" map and wait for the async call to finish in the onMap.\n```\n\nBut if we want to actually do async mapping then we can leave this more like you have it.",
